{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04060","headline":"兴庆池侍宴应制 · 苏頲","name":"兴庆池侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"降鹤池前回步辇，栖鸾树杪出行宫。\n山光积翠遥疑逼，水态含青近若空。\n直视天河垂象外，俯窥京室画图中。\n皇欢未使恩波极，日暮楼船更起风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}